      "message": "[error] Line 91: 🔴 The Visual Studio presence check is too weak: it only requires `Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.x86.x64`, then returns early. A host with C++ tools but without ATL and/or SDK 10.0.26100.0 will be treated as fully configured, but later native builds can fail due to missing prerequisites. Update the `vswhere` check to require all mandatory components (at least VC.Tools.x86.x64, VC.ATL, and Windows11SDK.26100), or run a modify install when any required component is missing.",
